WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.488
Welcome to Luggage Atlas. In about two minutes, here’s how to compare products, build

00:00:04.488 --> 00:00:08.976
a cost scenario, and export your shortlist.

00:00:09.626 --> 00:00:14.702
Start with the weekly dashboard for dated launches. Open Outside and Inside for product

00:00:14.702 --> 00:00:19.778
photos, or Style and Shoppers to understand the design appeal.

00:00:20.428 --> 00:00:24.804
Open Innovation and Tech to see the mechanism behind a feature, the travel problem

00:00:24.804 --> 00:00:29.180
it solves, and brands using it. Review trend evidence and Open Story development ideas

00:00:29.180 --> 00:00:33.556
before comparing the available offers.

00:00:34.206 --> 00:00:39.090
Open Compare and Cost. Search a brand or model, then select up to four

00:00:39.090 --> 00:00:43.974
priced offers. Your selections stay saved as you search.

00:00:44.624 --> 00:00:50.048
Compare the named products, retail prices, features and supplier evidence side by side. Photo

00:00:50.048 --> 00:00:55.472
references may differ from the exact priced model or color.

00:00:56.122 --> 00:01:01.482
Enter your own assumptions in U.S. dollars: F O B, freight, duty allowance, and

00:01:01.482 --> 00:01:06.842
other unit costs. Set planned retail and quantity. Landed cost and gross margin update

00:01:06.842 --> 00:01:12.202
automatically. Blank costs stay unknown.

00:01:12.852 --> 00:01:18.792
For a non-dollar offer, enter your own exchange rate to show its retail price

00:01:18.792 --> 00:01:24.732
in dollars. Cost assumptions are planning inputs, not supplier quotes or verified tariff rates.

00:01:25.382 --> 00:01:31.126
Choose Export Selected CSV. Your download includes only selected offers, with cost inputs, calculations,

00:01:31.126 --> 00:01:36.870
photo links and source links. Open it in Excel. CSV files contain image links,

00:01:36.870 --> 00:01:42.614
not embedded photos.

00:01:43.264 --> 00:01:49.804
In Suppliers and Factories, search a brand and expand Verify with Sources. Review the

00:01:49.804 --> 00:01:56.344
company name, dated evidence and model limitations. You’re ready to compare, cost and share.
